@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam ArrowColor #41546B
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F5F8FC
skinparam classBorderColor #59708C
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #EEF3F9
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #59708C
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor transparent
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
hide footbox
title RBAC1 设置角色继承 · structured
participant "obj: DomainRbacAdminController" as C
participant "service: StructuredDomainRbacService" as S
participant "roles: RoleRepository" as RR
participant "roleInheritances: RoleInheritanceRepository" as RIR
participant "cache: PermissionCache" as Cache
participant "webhooks: WebhookUseCase" as W
autonumber
activate C
C -> S: roleParents(role, dept, app, parentIds, actor)
activate S
S -> RR: lockIds = findIdsByDomain(dept, app) ∪ {role} ∪ parentIds（写事务外）
activate RR
deactivate RR
group 写事务（TransactionTemplate）
 S -> RR: domainRoleIds = lockDomainRolesByIds(dept, app, lockIds)
 activate RR
 deactivate RR
 note right of S: 首条 SQL 仅按 PRIMARY(id) 升序加排他锁，不提前开启 ReadView
 S -> RIR: edges = findEdgesByDomain(dept, app)
 activate RIR
 deactivate RIR
 alt 自身、跨域或循环继承
  S --> C: ApiException (403/409)
 else 合法
  S -> RIR: replaceParents(role, dept, app, existing, parentIds, roles::getReferenceById)
  activate RIR
  deactivate RIR
  S -> Cache: touchDomain(dept, app)
  activate Cache
  deactivate Cache
  S -> W: emit(role.inheritance.changed)
  activate W
  deactivate W
  S --> C: 200 OkVO
 end
end
deactivate S
deactivate C
legend bottom
写事务首条 SQL 为 PRIMARY(id) 升序排他锁，随后无锁 findEdgesByDomain 在持锁后才建立 ReadView，
无 role_inheritances 共享锁且按精确联合主键差集删旧插新，彻底避免同域与跨域死锁。
endlegend
@enduml
